  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raising the Cost of Corruption Activity (RCC)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this activity is to empower independent journalists and outlets to deliver trustworthy news essential to building resilient, rights-respecting democracies. The activity will counter corruption and propaganda by building the capacity of independent media and fostering cross-border collaboration and learning across the region to shine a light on corrupt tactics and related propaganda narratives.</narrative>
  </description>
